Phase 1: Installation

Go to your browser's extension store (Chrome, Firefox, or Opera).   
Lab practice - III Lab Manual.pdf

Click "Install MetaMask as a Google Chrome extension", then click "Add to Chrome" and "Add Extension".   
Lab practice - III Lab Manual.pdf

Phase 2: Account Creation

Click the newly added MetaMask extension icon in the upper right corner of the browser.   
Lab practice - III Lab Manual.pdf

Click "Try it now", then "Continue", and create a secure password.   
Lab practice - III Lab Manual.pdf

Accept the Terms of Use.   
Lab practice - III Lab Manual.pdf

Phase 3: The Secret Phrase (Critical Step)

Click "Reveal Secret Words" to view your 12-word seed phrase. Write this down.   
Lab practice - III Lab Manual.pdf

The system will ask you to verify the phrase by selecting the words in the exact order they were presented.   
Lab practice - III Lab Manual.pdf

Click "Confirm". Your account and new Ethereum public address are now successfully created.   
Lab practice - III Lab Manual.pdf
+ 1

Phase 4: Depositing & Transacting

To receive funds, click "View Account" to see and share your public Ethereum address.   
Lab practice - III Lab Manual.pdf

To send crypto, click the "Send" button, input the recipient's address and the amount, and select a transaction fee.   
Lab practice - III Lab Manual.pdf

Viva Tip: You can manually adjust this transaction fee (gas price) in the "Advanced Options" using data from platforms like ETH Gas Station.   
